Subsite ***\nUniversity\nUniversity\nVisionary since 1829: The University of Stuttgart stands for exceptional, world-acclaimed research and first-class teaching in one of Europe\u2019s most vibrant industrial areas. The university is a reliable employer, partner for technology transfer and focuses on interdisciplinarity.\n\u00a9\nLoad more\nNumbers, data, facts, and rankings\nStatistics about students, employment and finances: figures of the university\nAnnals of the University of Stuttgart\nFrom industrial school to international research university in two centuries\nDiversity\nHumanity in all its variety enriches the University. Equal opportunity, equal rights, and diversity characterize our working together.\nDigitalization\nThe University of Stuttgart introduce innovative processes into research, teaching and administration alongside a modern digital infrastructure.\nSustainability\nThe University of Stuttgart takes responsibility for sustainable development\nIntelligent systems to benefit society\nThe University of Stuttgart is one of the leading technically oriented universities in Germany with global significance. It sees itself as a center of university-based, non-university, and industrial research. Furthermore, it takes a role as a guarantor of research-based teaching, focused on quality and holism. The university promotes the transfer of knowledge and technologies to society in all its areas of expertise and competence. The \u201eStuttgarter Weg\u201d (Stuttgart Way) means an interdisciplinary integration of engineering, natural sciences, humanities, management, economics and social sciences based on the fundamentals of cutting-edge research at a disciplinary level. Our vision is \u201cIntelligent systems to benefit society\u201d.\nResearch\nStudy\nContinuing education\nIntelligent systems to benefit society.\nVision of the University of Stuttgart\nNews\nAll news, press releases, and upcoming events.\nProfile\nThe University of Stuttgart is a leading, technologically oriented university with a global \u2026\nThe University as employer\nThe University of Stuttgart prides itself on being an attractive, dependable employer that attracts \u2026\nOrganization\nWho is in charge of the University? What functions do the different Committees have? Which tasks \u2026\nFaculties and institutes\nThe University of Stuttgart consists of ten different faculties. A group of cohesive institutes \u2026\nFacilities\nFacilities on and near the University of Stuttgart campuses house and foster top quality networked \u2026\nInternational affairs\nNumerous global study and research cooperations, large contingents of international students, \u2026\nUni for all\nDiscover the University of Stuttgart as an open educational space for everyone: from introductory \u2026\nOur campus\nStudents study, conduct research, and live on our campus. Get to know our Vaihingen and City Center \u2026\nContact and directions\nAddress, contact form and central contact points for your questions.\nIcon: Facebook\nFacebook\nIcon: Instagram\nInstagram\nIcon: Bluesky\nBluesky\nIcon: Mastodon\nMastodon\nIcon: YouTube\nYouTube\nIcon: LinkedIn\nLinkedIn\nIcon: USUS-Blog\nUSUS-Blog\nAudience\nStudents\nEmployees\nAlumni and supporters\nIndustry\nFormalities\nLegal notice\nPrivacy notice\nAccessibility\nCertificates\nAGB\nServices\nContact & directions\nPress\nJobs\nApply for a Doctorate or Postdoc\nUni-Shop\nOrganization\nRectorate\nFaculties and Institutes\nFacilities\nCentral Administration\nTo the top of the page", "links": [["jump to content", "https://www.uni-stuttgart.de/en/university/#main"], ["jump to footer", "https://www.uni-stuttgart.de/en/university/#footer"], ["", "https://www.uni-stuttgart.de/en/"], ["de", "https://www.uni-stuttgart.de/universitaet/"], ["back", "https://www.uni-stuttgart.de/en/university/"], ["University", "https://www.uni-stuttgart.de/en/university/#level-1-0"], ["Research", "https://www.uni-stuttgart.de/en/university/#level-1-1"], ["Stu